// The AI builds its base (WP9.1b-1, docs/rules/ai.md): player 0 (Meridian) is the AI with a construction
// centre and 6000 credits on the first match's map (`assets/maps/m1`); player 1 (Veyran) is a lone static
// construction centre. No scripted command: everything player 0 does is the AI's. It walks the goal list
// of its profile (power plant, refinery, barracks, power plant, vehicle factory, defence tower, refinery,
// radar, defence tower, advanced defences), with a third power plant before the radar by the power rule,
// and each refinery brings its free harvester, which mines the ore field east of the base by itself.
//
// `unit_defs` names a FROZEN copy (ai_base_defs, made for WP9.1b-1) of the shipped definitions, the match
// file of this scenario and the profile `assets/ai/normal.ron`, so editing the shipped definitions or
// profile never moves this checksum or the AI digest. The ore, harvest, storage, money, production
// (with the game's build speed 3/2), power and vision numbers are those of the shipped `assets/config/`
// files and `unit_defs.ron` of that day, written out here.
Scenario(
    name: "ai_base",
    seed: 0xA1_BA5E,
    map: (width: 96, height: 96),
    map_name: Some("m1"),
    unit_defs: Some("ai_base_defs"),
    match_file: Some("match.ron"),
    ai: [(player: 0, profile: "normal.ron", seed: 0xA1_0001)],
    buildings: true,
    combat: true,
    targeting: true,
    destruction: true,
    ore: Some((start: 120, max: 160, regrow_amount: 1, regrow_period: 200)),
    harvest: Some((
        harvesters: [11],
        capacity: 200,
        mine_amount: 4,
        mine_period: 8,
        unload_amount: 10,
        unload_period: 4,
        search_radius: 40,
        retry_period: 100,
        call_range: 6,
        grant_timeout: 400,
        call_timeout: 10,
        max_tries: 3,
        park_distance: 4,
        park_spread: 5,
        park_near_tenths: 20,
        mine_start_tenths: 10,
        mine_reach_tenths: 15,
        mine_lose_tenths: 25,
        dock_reach_tenths: 20,
        travel_cost: 16,
        queue_cost: 100,
        switch_margin: 100,
        recheck_period: 20,
        queue_gap: 3,
        queue_start: 1,
        queue_step: 2,
        queue_rows: 8,
    )),
    storage: Some([(2, 2000), (43, 1500)]),
    money: Some((credits_per_ore: 1)),
    production: Some((queue_limit: 5, exit_radius: 4, build_speed: (3, 2))),
    power: Some((shortage_floor_permille: 250, defence_cutoff_permille: 1000)),
    vision: Some((legacy_sight_milli: 5000, acquire_needs_sight: true)),
    ticks: 10000,
    commands: [],
)
